---
title: Bazinga MVP - Container Architecture
---
graph TD
    DEV([Developer])

    subgraph BZ["Bazinga"]
        WEB[Web UI]
        SERVER[Bazinga Local Server]
        IMPL[Implementation Agent]
        STATE[(State Store)]
    end

    subgraph PROJECT["Target Project Workspace"]
        REPO[Project Files]
        ARTIFACTS[(Project Artifacts)]
    end

    subgraph EXT["External Services"]
        LLM[LLM Provider]
        GITHUB[GitHub / CI]
    end

    DEV -->|Reviews diagrams, approves intent| WEB
    WEB -->|Chat, artifacts, approvals; WebSocket| SERVER
    SERVER -->|Streams responses, diagram state; WebSocket| WEB
    SERVER -->|Persists sessions and approvals| STATE
    SERVER -->|Reads repo context| REPO
    SERVER -->|Writes diagrams, PRDs, roadmap| ARTIFACTS
    SERVER -->|Chat, diagram, PRD generation; HTTPS| LLM
    SERVER -->|Dispatches approved PRD| IMPL
    IMPL -->|Spawns worktree, runs OpenCode| REPO
    IMPL -->|Reports implementation status| SERVER
    IMPL -.->|Creates PRs, reads checks; HTTPS| GITHUB
